# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. A bare `artifacts/` matches a directory of that
# name at ANY depth, which silently excluded packages/gate/src/artifacts/serve.ts from every
# commit — the file existed locally, `git add -A` skipped it without a word, and CI could not
# compile the package.
